# Frontend & Design System Standards

When modifying frontend components, adhere to:
- [.agents/rules/typescript.md](../../.agents/rules/typescript.md): Strict mode, zero `any`, Zod schemas.
- [.agents/rules/ui-taste-principles.md](../../.agents/rules/ui-taste-principles.md): Linear aesthetics, 1px borders, tabular numbers.
- [docs/design-system/tokens.md](../../docs/design-system/tokens.md): WCAG AAA color tokens, window-scoped hotkey scoping.
